# Emitted by `next dev` via node_modules/next/dist/server/lib/generate-agent-files.js.
# Generated, not authored: ui/AGENTS.md is a rewritten copy of node_modules/next/AGENTS.md
# and its only pointer is into the ignored node_modules/next/dist/docs/, so committing it
# would freeze version-coupled guidance and reference a path absent from a fresh clone.
# Ignored rather than deleted because `next dev` re-creates both on every run.
ui/AGENTS.md

# Provider selections are source-controlled; do not ignore .terraform.lock.hcl.
